var e={mood:[{id:`mood_week_monday`,rank:2,when:e=>e.week&&e.weekDay===1,lines:[`Monday, and this time it does not count on its own. Four more are already waiting behind it, lined up neatly like tickets.`,`The first of five. This morning I briefly considered calling in sick for the entire week. One is allowed to think it.`,`Start of the week. Whatever I leave lying today will still be lying there tomorrow — these days that is meant literally.`]},{id:`mood_week_friday`,rank:2,when:e=>e.week&&e.weekDay===5,lines:[`Friday. Four days are sitting in my bones, and all four of them left something behind.`,`The last day of the week. I can smell the weekend already, but this Friday is still in the way, like a wardrobe in a corridor.`,`Fifth day. I have stopped counting everything that happened this week — the backpack reminds me all by itself.`]},{id:`mood_week_mid`,rank:2,when:e=>e.week,lines:[`{weekday}. The week has found a rhythm, and it is not mine.`,`Another {weekday}, the same desk again, and the pile on it knows me by name by now.`,`{weekday}. I notice how the days are sticking to one another — what happened yesterday is not over yet today.`]},{id:`mood_monday`,rank:1,when:e=>e.difficulty===`hard`,lines:[`Monday. The word on its own is already a diagnosis.`,`A {weekday} straight out of the textbook: the company has survived the weekend, but learnt nothing from it.`,`The start of the week collected me today without asking first whether I wanted to come along.`]},{id:`mood_friday`,rank:1,when:e=>e.difficulty===`easy`,lines:[`Friday. Half the company was already sitting in the car in spirit, the other half in the traffic jam.`,`A {weekday} on which even the servers run more slowly, because otherwise it is not worth their while.`,`As the week draws to a close the madness takes a break. Not for long, but still.`]},{id:`mood_streak`,rank:1,when:e=>e.survived&&e.streak>=4,lines:[`I have stopped keeping count of how many days in a row I have been holding out now. The company does the counting.`,`Things have been going astonishingly smoothly for days. Which is exactly why I do not trust the peace.`]},{id:`mood_rage`,rank:2,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_rage`),lines:[`Today I was a walking powder keg. One wrong word and I would have set fire to the router.`,`My pulse was constantly at 180 today. Several times I considered simply setting off the fire alarm.`,`If looks could kill, the open-plan office would have become a graveyard today.`]},{id:`mood_lazy`,rank:2,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_lazy`),lines:[`My motto today: why work today when one can also postpone it indefinitely?`,`Today I absolutely perfected the art of productive work avoidance.`,`If idling were an Olympic sport, I would have brought the company gold today.`]},{id:`mood_ascetic`,rank:2,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_ascetic`),lines:[`I survived the day without a drop of coffee – my head is pounding with virtue.`,`No caffeine today. I am functioning on pure willpower and suppressed rage alone.`,`A completely decaffeinated day. I feel like an empty shell, but my blood pressure is fantastic.`]},{id:`mood_coffee`,rank:2,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_coffee`),lines:[`My blood is by now 90% caffeine. I can taste colours.`,`I am shaking all over. Not from fear, but because I emptied half the coffee machine.`,`If I drink one more espresso I can probably travel through time. My pulse is going for a record.`]},{id:`mood_workaholic`,rank:2,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_workaholic`),lines:[`I genuinely worked so hard today that I am making the rest of us look bad.`,`Today I was frighteningly productive. I hope Management does not get used to it.`,`A day like a machine gun. Tickets solved, problems fixed. I effectively carried the whole company single-handed today.`]},{id:`mood_default`,rank:0,when:()=>!0,lines:[`Another day of everyday corporate madness draws to a close.`,`Another eight hours of my life that nobody is going to give back to me.`,`The strip lights hummed, the coffee was cold, there was method in the madness.`]}],place:[{id:`place_quiet`,rank:1,when:e=>e.events<=12,lines:[`It has not been this manageable for a long time. At one point I sorted the filing, voluntarily.`,`The place ran almost without me today. A feeling somewhere between relief and insult.`]},{id:`place_full`,rank:1,when:e=>e.events>=30,lines:[`I was everywhere and nowhere today: server room, corridor, telephone, and back to the start.`,`My chair and I knew each other today mainly by hearsay.`]},{id:`place_corridors`,rank:2,when:e=>e.quests>e.server&&e.quests>e.calls,lines:[`Rather than deal with real problems, I preferred to drift aimlessly through the corridors like a ghost.`,`My principal duty today appeared to consist of solving odd office dramas well away from my own desk.`,`I was out on my rounds more often today than I was at my own desk.`]},{id:`place_server`,rank:2,when:e=>e.server>e.calls+2,lines:[`In order to keep out of the way of irritating human beings, I barricaded myself in the dark server room for most of it.`,`The loud fans in the server room were my only real company today.`,`I have almost built up an emotional bond today with the blinking racks in the basement.`]},{id:`place_phone`,rank:2,when:e=>e.calls>e.server+3,lines:[`It felt as though the phone were glued to my ear without a break. The users have taken my last nerve.`,`I had more support conversations today than a fully staffed call centre shift.`,`The constant ringing of the telephone will probably follow me into my dreams.`]},{id:`place_mixed`,rank:0,when:()=>!0,lines:[`Between beeping servers and panicking callers I somehow tried to keep the operation running.`,`A chaotic mixture of hardware failures and human incompetence kept me on the go today.`,`I ran from one fire to the next without ever really putting anything out.`]}],encounters:[{id:`enc_mentor`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_mentor`),lines:[`I saved apprentice Kevin from total IT collapse`,`I saved Kevin's skin`,`Kevin now owes me one for ever`]},{id:`enc_ally`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_ally`),lines:[`I forged an unholy alliance with Chantal from Marketing`,`Chantal and I are a deadly team now`,`Marketing is in my debt now`]},{id:`enc_rockstar`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_rockstar`),lines:[`Gabi entrusted me with her finest Death Metal Tape`,`Gabi and I were completely on the same wavelength musically`,`Gabi and I rocked Reception`]},{id:`enc_cat_whisperer`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_cat_whisperer`),lines:[`I solved the cat problem in Accounts`,`I became Ms Elster's official cat whisperer`,`Ms Elster's cat Rüdiger and I are practically best friends now`]},{id:`enc_keymaster`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_keymaster`),lines:[`Egon the caretaker let me have his master key`,`thanks to Egon I now theoretically fit in everywhere`,`thanks to Egon's key I now hold the real power in this building`]},{id:`enc_closer`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_closer`),lines:[`I rescued an extremely important deal with Markus from Sales`,`I literally saved the backside of the sales department`,`Markus would have lost his fat bonus today without me`]},{id:`enc_wolf`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_wolf`),lines:[`I prised a new employment contract out of the boss`,`I have finally moved up where salary is concerned`,`I absolutely dominated the boss in the salary negotiation`]},{id:`enc_hacker`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_hacker`),lines:[`I helped myself to illegal admin rights on the system`,`I hacked my way into the root directory unnoticed`,`thanks to the root password I am now the absolute god of the network`]},{id:`enc_rich`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_rich`),lines:[`I placed my trust in the Nigerian prince`,`I am going to be unbelievably rich (assuming the scam is genuine)`,`I shall soon have millions in the account (hopefully)`]},{id:`enc_chronicles`,when:e=>e.item(`corp_chronicles`),lines:[`I studied the forbidden company chronicle`,`I discovered dark truths in an old book`,`I read the founder's grim secrets in the chronicle`]},{id:`enc_prince_letter`,when:e=>e.item(`prince_letter`),lines:[`I am lugging this absurd letter from the Prince about with me`,`I received royal post today`,`a genuine letter from a prince fell into my hands`]}],encountersIntro:[{id:`enc_intro`,when:()=>!0,lines:[`What was especially memorable today was that {list}.`,`Looking back over the day, what stands out is that {list}.`,`People will be remembering for a good while yet that {list}.`]}],habits:[{id:`habit_ignore`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_ignore`),lines:[`the Del key was my absolute best friend where emails were concerned`,`I raised the ignoring of mail to an art form`,`I set a record today for deleting unread emails`]},{id:`habit_hoarder`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_hoarder`),lines:[`I stuffed my backpack full of absolute rubbish`,`I pocketed everything today that was not nailed down`,`I collected every piece of junk in the office like a proper loot goblin`]},{id:`habit_macgyver`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_macgyver`),lines:[`I felt like MacGyver with tape and cable ties`,`I solved IT problems on pure tinkering energy`,`I proved that you can repair simply anything with duct tape`]},{id:`habit_clean`,when:e=>e.ach(`ach_clean`),lines:[`I actually reached 'Inbox Zero' (a miracle!)`,`my ticket system was completely empty at the end`,`I worked through every damned ticket`]}],habitsIntro:[{id:`habit_intro_more`,when:e=>e.hasEncounters,lines:[`Otherwise today mainly came down to the fact that {list}.`,`Beyond that, today mainly came down to the fact that {list}.`,`Last of all, today mainly came down to the fact that {list}.`]},{id:`habit_intro_alone`,when:()=>!0,lines:[`My strategy today mainly came down to the fact that {list}.`,`My basic approach today mainly came down to the fact that {list}.`]}],warnings:[{id:`warn_rage`,when:e=>e.rageWarned&&!e.week,lines:[`I had half a nervous breakdown in the broom cupboard at one point`,`I came within a whisker of losing control completely today`,`I had to take my rage out on harmless office supplies today`]},{id:`warn_chef`,when:e=>e.chefWarned&&!e.week,lines:[`the boss has already threatened me with the sack today`,`I scraped past a summary dismissal by a hair's breadth`,`I have already collected one highly official and very loud written warning today`]},{id:`warn_week_valve`,when:e=>e.week&&e.rageWarned,lines:[`my valve for this week is already spent — the next outburst counts`,`I have already had to let off steam this week and the allowance is used up with it`]},{id:`warn_week_chef`,when:e=>e.week&&e.chefWarned,lines:[`this week's written warning is already in my file — the next would be the last`,`the boss has shot his bolt for this week, though so have I`]}],warningsIntro:[{id:`warn_intro_more`,when:e=>e.hasEncounters||e.hasHabits,lines:[`Oh yes, and it is also worth mentioning that {list}.`,`Nearly forgot: on top of that, {list}.`,`To cap it all it should be said that {list}.`]},{id:`warn_intro_alone`,when:()=>!0,lines:[`What was particularly delicate today was that {list}.`,`An absolute low point was that {list}.`]}],ending:[{id:`end_week_won`,rank:2,when:e=>e.week&&e.weekDay===5&&e.survived,lines:[`Five days. I saw all five of them, from the inside, at full length. Now the weekend is mine, and earned at that.`,`Friday, clocking off, week complete. I lock up, and for the first time since Monday nothing unlocks behind me.`,`The week is done. I leave the chair pushed in, the light off and the company simply being a company. Until Monday that is not my problem.`]},{id:`end_week_thursday`,rank:3,when:e=>e.week&&e.weekDay===4&&e.end===`WIN`,lines:[`Thursday managed. Only Friday to go — which sounds like very little and is, in my experience, the most.`,`One more day. I am going to sleep like a runner on the home straight: too tired for joy, too close to give up.`]},{id:`end_week_night`,rank:2,when:e=>e.week&&e.weekDay<5&&e.end===`WIN`,lines:[`Clocking off, but not finished: {restdays} days still to come. The machine goes off, the list does not.`,`Day ticked off, week not. I take home what the day left over, and tomorrow morning it spreads itself across the desk again.`,`Done for today. Tomorrow is another one of those days, and the day after too — this time that is not a turn of phrase but the state of play.`]},{id:`end_win_late`,rank:1,when:e=>e.end===`WIN`&&e.endHour>=16&&e.tickets<=1,lines:[`Half four, the list almost empty, lights out. That happens so rarely that I stopped for a moment in the doorway.`,`A clean end to the day with a clean queue. I shall tell nobody about it tomorrow, it would only raise expectations.`]},{id:`end_win_close`,rank:1,when:e=>e.end===`WIN`&&e.peakValue>=85,lines:[`Made it to clocking off, but it was close. How close I shall keep to myself.`,`The day scraped past me, not the other way round. I shall take the result regardless.`]},{id:`end_win_more`,rank:0,when:e=>e.end===`WIN`,lines:[`The machine is off, the door falls shut, the rest is tomorrow. On good days it is as simple as that.`,`I straightened the keyboard, put out the light and left before anybody could have an idea.`,`Clocking off. No applause, no credits, only the lift, which is somewhere else again.`]},{id:`end_rage_more`,rank:0,when:e=>e.end===`RAGE`,lines:[`Eventually I said everything I have been thinking for months. Loudly, unfortunately, and in full.`,`It was not the big bang. It was the last small one, and that was enough.`]},{id:`end_tickets_more`,rank:0,when:e=>e.end===`TICKETS`,lines:[`The queue won. It always wins in the end, only faster than usual today.`,`At some point one is only typing without reading. After that it does not take long.`]},{id:`end_fired_more`,rank:0,when:e=>e.end===`FIRED`,lines:[`The box was already standing ready when I came back. Efficient here they have only ever been about the wrong things.`,`My access was blocked before I reached the lift. That was the fastest reaction from IT in years, and it came from me.`]},{id:`end_rage`,when:e=>e.end===`RAGE`,lines:[`The bitter end of the tale? My fuse blew. A flying monitor is, after all, also a form of summary dismissal!`,`At some point I had had enough. I raged, I screamed and I left. A glorious exit that nobody here will forget in a hurry.`,`I lost control completely. It feels magnificent, even if I am probably unemployed tomorrow.`]},{id:`end_tickets`,when:e=>e.end===`TICKETS`,lines:[`The ticket avalanche buried me completely in the end. The system collapsed utterly – and I have lost my job.`,`The flood of requests could not be stopped any more. I capitulated. Tomorrow I shall be out on the street.`,`The ticket limit was blown apart. The boss pulled the plug personally. End of performance.`]},{id:`end_fired`,when:e=>e.end===`FIRED`,lines:[`That security escorted me out personally at the end is the perfect full stop to this sorry affair.`,`The boss meant it. My things are packed, my career here is officially and finally over.`,`A cold look, a short word from HR, and that was that. I am sacked. There is one consolation: I never have to see this carpet again.`]},{id:`end_win`,when:e=>e.end===`WIN`,lines:[`Somehow I made it alive to 16:30. Clocking off. Tomorrow the whole circus starts over again...`,`The clock jumps to clocking-off time. I close the laptop and flee. Another day in IT hell successfully survived.`,`Survived. Exhausted, but alive. What I urgently need now is something considerably stronger than coffee.`]},{id:`end_party`,when:e=>e.end===`PARTY`,lines:[`Then came 16:30 and the ominous Synergy Gala. {party}`]}],postscript:[{id:`post_week_baggage`,rank:1,when:e=>e.week&&e.survived&&e.weekDay<5&&e.tickets>0,lines:[`Postscript: I am taking {tickets} tickets to bed with me. Not literally, but they will be there all the same when I wake up.`,`Postscript: the queue does not sleep, it merely waits. {tickets} of them will be standing to attention again in the morning.`,`Postscript: I did not finish the open tickets, I deferred them. The word makes a difference, the feeling does not.`]},{id:`post_week_clean`,rank:1,when:e=>e.week&&e.survived&&e.weekDay<5&&e.tickets===0,lines:[`Postscript: queue empty. Tomorrow I start at zero — in the literal sense, and in this week that is the nearest thing to a holiday.`,`Postscript: not a single ticket stays open overnight. I have the feeling the system is already planning a countermeasure.`]},{id:`blind_hard`,rank:2,when:e=>e.survived&&e.blind&&e.difficulty===`hard`,lines:[`Postscript: I did not see a single number all Monday. No percentages, no ticket counts, nothing. Only faces, tone of voice and the noise the coffee machine makes when it is too late. I got through it anyway. To this moment I do not know how close it was, and I do not want to know either.`,`Postscript: Monday, blind. I read the day the way a sailor reads the weather — by the way Gabi says 'good morning', by how long Markus stops in the doorway, by whether the boss's door was open. It worked. Nobody is more surprised than I am.`,`Postscript: not a single bar, not a single counter, and a Monday into the bargain. At some point one stops calculating and starts sensing how the place is standing. That is either experience or the first stage of madness. Probably both.`]},{id:`blind_easy`,rank:2,when:e=>e.survived&&e.blind&&e.difficulty===`easy`,lines:[`Postscript: I hid every display today. No percentage, no ticket count. On a Friday that is no great feat, but it was astonishingly quiet in my head with nobody constantly totting up how I am doing.`,`Postscript: the whole day without numbers. One notices quickly that the colleagues are the more honest instruments — the numbers only tell you how bad it is, the colleagues tell you why.`]},{id:`blind_normal`,rank:2,when:e=>e.survived&&e.blind,lines:[`Postscript: today I switched off every display and worked the day by feel. No percentages, no open counters, only the place and me. In hindsight the clearest view I have had in months.`,`Postscript: an entire working day without a single metric. No dashboard, no counter, no bar slowly turning red. Only people, noises and experience. One ought to do it more often. One will not do it more often.`,`Postscript: worked blind, from eight until clocking off. When somebody asked at midday how things stood, for the first time I could answer honestly: no idea. And it was all right anyway.`]}],rhythm:[{id:`rhythm_calm`,rank:2,when:e=>e.calm&&e.survived,lines:[`The day ran so quietly that at one point I checked whether the telephone was still plugged in at all.`,`Not one bar moved seriously towards red today. Suspicious.`,`A working day without incident. I tapped it twice looking for one and found none.`]},{id:`rhythm_late_peak`,rank:2,when:e=>e.peakHour>=14&&e.peakValue>=60,lines:[`Up to midday I had everything under control. What came after had nothing to do with the morning any more.`,`The morning was scenery. The actual performance began some time after two.`,`In the early afternoon the day tipped over, and it did so in a single movement.`]},{id:`rhythm_early_peak`,rank:2,when:e=>e.peakHour<=10&&e.peakValue>=60,lines:[`Everything had been said before nine. The rest was clearing up.`,`The day shot its bolt straight after the first coffee. After that it went downhill, for once in the good sense.`,`I had barely sat down and it was on fire. By eleven the high point was past, and frankly so was I.`]},{id:`rhythm_boss`,rank:1,when:e=>e.boss>=2,lines:[`Twice today everything hung in the balance, and twice it was enough. Statistics call that sort of thing experience.`,`The day had several moments in which the clock mattered more than reason.`]},{id:`rhythm_grind`,rank:1,when:e=>e.events>=30,lines:[`I got more done today than in some whole weeks and still could not say which of it made any difference.`,`A day on piecework. In hindsight the individual matters blur into one single long matter.`,`So many small things that by evening not one of them can be remembered on its own.`]},{id:`rhythm_short`,rank:1,when:e=>!e.survived&&e.events<=12,lines:[`The day was short. Not because little happened, but because it ended prematurely.`,`For an aborted working day an astonishing amount of damage turned out to be possible.`]},{id:`rhythm_default`,rank:0,when:()=>!0,lines:[`The day had its waves: quiet first, then busy, then quiet again, and me somewhere in between.`,`Seen from outside a perfectly ordinary working day. Seen from inside likewise, and that is precisely the problem.`,`A day without high points, but with lows that nobody minuted.`]}],detail:[{id:`detail_coffee_many`,rank:2,when:e=>e.coffee>=4,lines:[`Coffee balance: {coffee} cups. The machine knows me better by now than HR does.`,`After cup number {coffee} I accepted the trembling in my fingers as background noise.`,`I drank so much coffee today that I can hear my own pulse.`]},{id:`detail_coffee_none`,rank:2,when:e=>e.coffee===0&&e.events>=8,lines:[`Not a single cup today. I avoided the kitchen the way a deer avoids the main road.`,`Zero coffee. To this moment I do not know whether that was discipline or simply no opportunity.`]},{id:`detail_tickets_high`,rank:2,when:e=>e.tickets>=7,lines:[`At the end there were {tickets} tickets open. They will still be there tomorrow, loyal as nothing else in this company.`,`The queue stood at {tickets} at the last count. That is not a backlog any more, that is a holding.`]},{id:`detail_tickets_zero`,rank:2,when:e=>e.tickets===0&&e.survived,lines:[`No open tickets. I reloaded the view three times because I did not want to believe it.`,`The list was empty by evening. Something like that happens perhaps twice a year, and there is nobody there to witness it.`]},{id:`detail_mails`,rank:2,when:e=>e.mailsIgnored>=3,lines:[`I disposed of {mails} mails unread. Not one of them has been missed so far.`,`My inbox lost {mails} messages today and I not one second of sleep over it.`]},{id:`detail_boss`,rank:2,when:e=>e.boss>=1,lines:[`Once today the place was on the brink of standstill. It was enough, but only because I was quicker than the clock.`,`There was that one moment when everything was flashing at the same time. I survived it and do not wish to talk about it.`]},{id:`detail_excuses`,rank:1,when:e=>e.excusesUsed>=1,lines:[`I talked my way out of something {excuses} times today. Every excuse was worse than the one before and worked regardless.`,`An invented urgency saved me one more time. I ought to write the formulations down.`]},{id:`detail_lunch`,rank:1,when:e=>e.lunch,lines:[`Took a lunch break, at least. Twenty minutes in which nobody wanted anything from me are a currency around here.`,`The lunch break was the only appointment today that I kept voluntarily.`]},{id:`detail_items`,rank:1,when:e=>e.items>=5,lines:[`The backpack is heavier in the evening than it was in the morning. None of it belongs to me, and nobody is going to ask after it.`]},{id:`detail_leet`,rank:1,when:e=>e.leet,lines:[`At 13:37 I looked at the clock and was then annoyed with myself for having noticed.`]},{id:`detail_streak`,rank:1,when:e=>e.survived&&e.streak>=3,lines:[`{streak} days in a row got through. My expectations of myself are sinking pleasingly fast.`]}],people:[{id:`people_both`,rank:3,when:e=>e.upBy>=5&&e.downBy>=5,lines:[`All told: {up} likes me more today, {down} considerably less. In this company that is presumably a zero-sum game.`,`Today I gained with {up} and lost with {down}. Somebody else draws up the balance anyway.`]},{id:`people_up_strong`,rank:2,when:e=>e.upBy>=15,lines:[`{up} changed sides today, and to mine at that. I ought to make use of it while it lasts.`,`I made up {upBy} points with {up}. In my experience that sort of thing lasts until the next disruption.`]},{id:`people_down_strong`,rank:2,when:e=>e.downBy>=15,lines:[`Since this afternoon {down} has spoken only the bare minimum to me. Deserved, but unpleasant.`,`With {down} I threw away in a single day what I had built up over weeks.`]},{id:`people_up`,rank:1,when:e=>e.upBy>=5,lines:[`{up} was conspicuously friendly today. Either I did something right, or a request is on its way.`,`{up} at least appears to be content with the day. So one of the two of us is.`]},{id:`people_down`,rank:1,when:e=>e.downBy>=5,lines:[`{down} looked at me differently today than yesterday, and not for the better.`,`Since today there is something outstanding with {down} that cannot be settled with work.`]},{id:`people_quiet`,rank:0,when:e=>e.upBy<5&&e.downBy<5&&e.events>=10,lines:[`Nothing happened on the interpersonal front today. For a sysadmin that is the ideal state.`,`Nobody likes me more or less today than yesterday. I count that as a success.`]}]};export{e as diary};